Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox LocalRecall — on-box AI memory store
 Long-term, on-box memory store for AI assistants: conversation
 history, learned operator preferences, project context. Local
 storage only — nothing leaves the box. Pairs with secubox-mcp-server
 if exposing memory contents to MCP-compatible AI clients.
